{"unit_id":"Jaylor-Wang__dsh-tool-lsp#feature-diagnostics","repo":"Jaylor-Wang/dsh-tool-lsp","commit":"3244d8ec49073ab69b6712c35f8c36b970fc9520","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-lsp 的功能「代码诊断」：查询指定文件的语言服务器错误、警告和提示，并合并主动推送与请求拉取的诊断。调用 lsp_diagnostics，输入工作区相对或绝对文件路径，返回整理后的诊断文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:151-186"]}
{"unit_id":"Jaylor-Wang__dsh-tool-lsp#feature-format","repo":"Jaylor-Wang/dsh-tool-lsp","commit":"3244d8ec49073ab69b6712c35f8c36b970fc9520","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-lsp 的功能「代码格式化」：使用对应语言服务器格式化整份文件或指定范围。调用 lsp_format 并传入文件路径及可选范围，插件将格式化结果写回文件并返回差异。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:191-223"]}
{"unit_id":"Jaylor-Wang__dsh-tool-lsp#feature-rename","repo":"Jaylor-Wang/dsh-tool-lsp","commit":"3244d8ec49073ab69b6712c35f8c36b970fc9520","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-lsp 的功能「语义重命名」：在指定文件位置请求语言服务器重命名符号，并将工作区编辑写入受影响文件。调用 lsp_rename，提供路径、行列位置和新名称，可查看返回的文件差异。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:267-320"]}
{"unit_id":"Jaylor-Wang__dsh-tool-lsp#feature-actions","repo":"Jaylor-Wang/dsh-tool-lsp","commit":"3244d8ec49073ab69b6712c35f8c36b970fc9520","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-lsp 的功能「代码动作」：查询语言服务器在指定范围提供的快速修复、重构或源代码动作。调用 lsp_code_action，可省略范围以定位首个诊断；工具只报告动作供调用者选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:344-389"]}
